# Multi-Section Chaining

Two sections, `request-separator`-divided, chained purely through a `runtime-variables` capture — no CRUD resource involved, just the mechanism itself. Section one captures a value from its response; section two sends that value back as a header and section two's own assertions prove it survived the trip.

